hpc:JobDescription a owl:Class .
hpc:hasScript an owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:hasEnvironment an owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:Environment a owl:Class .
hpc:hasFOO an owl:DatatypeProperty .

hpc:JobDescription rdfs:subClassOf owl:NamedIndividual .
hpc:hasScript rdfs:domain hpc:JobDescription ;
                 rdfs:range xsd:anyURI .
hpc:hasEnvironment rdfs:domain hpc:JobDescription ;
                   rdfs:range hpc:Environment .
hpc:Environment rdfs:subClassOf owl:NamedIndividual .
hpc:hasFOO rdfs:domain hpc:Environment ;
               rdfs:range xsd:string .
```

This ontology fragment represents the JobDescription class, which has two properties: hasScript and hasEnvironment. The hasScript property is an object property that has a range of any URI, and the hasEnvironment property is an object property that has a range of the Environment class. The Environment class is a subclass of owl:NamedIndividual and has a datatype property called hasFOO with a range of xsd:string.
